message: "If you use this model or code, please cite it as below."
title: "MOSS-TTS-v1.5 8B — Voice-Acting fine-tune"
authors:
  - name: "LAION"
date-released: 2026-07-12
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://huggingface.co/laion/moss-tts-v1.5-8b-voice-acting"
abstract: >
  An expressive, instruction-controlled text-to-speech model: a fine-tune of MOSS-TTS-v1.5 8B
  (Qwen3-8B backbone with a 32-codebook delay audio head, MossTTSDelay, at 24 kHz) for voice
  acting and emotional voice cloning, with fast batched inference and reward-guided best-of-N
  selection.
